                    <chunk name="param_input" index="2">
                      <items count="9">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">How to render the field: Point Cloud (colored samples, filtered to the Min/Max band), Heatmap Mesh (colors a supplied mesh from the samples on each face), or Volumetric Cloud (translucent points, more opaque the higher the value — for reading a plume in 3D).</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">a8e9cd1a-7519-4b87-9dd6-f625449fad62</item>
